 isolated Bamboo tile with no potential to form melds with my current hand structure. My hand is developing toward a Bamboo-focused strategy with B2-B3-B4-B5 sequential tiles and a strong W2 concealed pung. Discarding T6 maintains maximum flexibility for completing chows in Bamboo suit while preserving the valuable W2 pung.\n\nAnswer: Play T6"}
